    },
    "FlatRadar didn't run smoothly recently. Sending the diagnostic report helps fix the issue.\n\nWhat's included: crash stack trace, app version, device model, iOS version. No personal info or app data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar no ha funcionado correctamente últimamente. Enviar el informe de diagnóstico ayuda a solucionar el problema.\n\nQué incluye: traza de pila del fallo, versión de la aplicación, modelo del dispositivo y versión de iOS. No incluye información personal ni datos de la aplicación."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar werkte de afgelopen tijd niet optimaal. Door het diagnostische rapport te versturen, help je ons het probleem op te lossen.\n\nWat zit erin: crash-stacktrace, app-versie, apparaatmodel, iOS-versie. Geen persoonlijke gegevens of app-gegevens."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar 近期运行不稳定。发送诊断报告有助于修复问题。\n\n包含内容：崩溃堆栈、应用版本、设备型号、iOS 版本。不含个人信息或应用数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar 近期運行不穩定。發送診斷報告有助於修復問題。\n\n包含內容：崩潰堆疊、應用版本、裝置型號、iOS 版本。不含個人資訊或應用資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FlatRadar is an **independent** third-party client.\nNot affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any of the platforms it monitors.\nAll listing data belongs to its respective owners.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar is an **independent** third-party client.\nNot affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any of the platforms it monitors.\nAll listing data belongs to its respective owners."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar es un cliente **independiente** de terceros.\nNo está afiliado, respaldado ni patrocinado por ninguna de las plataformas que monitoriza.\nTodos los datos de los anuncios pertenecen a sus respectivos propietarios."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar is een **onafhankelijke** client van derden.\nNiet gelieerd aan, onderschreven door of gesponsord door een van de platforms die het volgt.\nAlle advertentiegegevens behoren toe aan de respectieve eigenaren."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar 是一个**独立**的第三方客户端。\n与它监测的任何平台均无隶属、认可或赞助关系。\n所有房源数据归各自所有者所有。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar 是一個**獨立**的第三方用戶端。\n與它監測的任何平台均無隸屬、認可或贊助關係。\n所有房源資料歸各自所有者所有。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FlatRadar is an **unofficial** third-party client.\nNot affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any of the platforms it monitors.\nAll listing data belongs to its respective owners.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar is an **unofficial** third-party client.\nNot affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any of the platforms it monitors.\nAll listing data belongs to its respective owners."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar es un cliente de terceros **no oficial**.\nNo está afiliado, avalado ni patrocinado por ninguna de las plataformas que monitoriza.\nTodos los datos de los anuncios pertenecen a sus respectivos propietarios."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar is een **onofficiële** client van derden.\nNiet gelieerd aan, goedgekeurd door of gesponsord door de platforms die het volgt.\nAlle advertentiegegevens behoren toe aan de respectieve eigenaren."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar 是**非官方**第三方客户端。\n与其监控的任何平台均无关联、未获认可或赞助。\n所有房源数据归各自所有者所有。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar 是**非官方**第三方用戶端。\n與其監控的任何平台均無關聯、未獲認可或贊助。\n所有房源資料歸各自擁有者所有。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "FlatRadar watches %lld Dutch rental platforms and gathers their listings into a single feed.\nEvery listing is labelled with the platform it came from.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar vigila %lld plataformas de alquiler neerlandesas y reúne sus anuncios en un único listado.\nCada anuncio indica de qué plataforma procede."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar volgt %lld Nederlandse huurplatforms en brengt hun woningen samen in één overzicht.\nBij elke woning staat van welk platform die komt."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar 持续监控 %lld 个荷兰租房平台，把它们的房源汇总到一处。\n每条房源都标注了来源平台。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "FlatRadar 持續監控 %lld 個荷蘭租房平台，把它們的房源匯總到一處。\n每條房源都標註了來源平台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
